# Selectors for css-report on 21-TEST-RULE-NOTE.md
# The `kind: note` variant renders on .rpg-rule-side--letter (NOT .rpg-rule-side--note,
# which is the blue `type: note` PRESET). The keyword lives on data-rpg-side-kind="note".
.rpg-rule-side--letter
.rpg-rule-side--letter .rpg-rule-side__header
.rpg-rule-side--letter .rpg-rule-side__title
.rpg-rule-side--letter .rpg-rule-side__body
.rpg-rule-side--letter.rpg-rule-side--danger
